  "result": "The bug has been fixed. The condition on line 69 of `src/server/services/search-service.ts` was inverted—it was throwing an error when advanced search **was** enabled, instead of when it **wasn't** enabled.\n\nThe fix changes:\n```typescript\nif (input.q.includes(\":\") && advanced) {\n```\n\nto:\n```typescript\nif (input.q.includes(\":\") && !advanced) {\n```\n\nNow the logic correctly:\n- Allows customers with field-scoped search in their plan to use colon syntax\n- Blocks customers without that feature from using colon syntax",
